idpdiag-key-missing-fix = Open Signing keys and choose “Rotate now” to generate a key.
idpdiag-key-expired = The active { $alg } key { $kid } is expired ({ $days } days old; the rotation policy is { $policy } days). Relying parties may refuse its tokens.
idpdiag-key-expired-fix = Open Signing keys and choose “Rotate now”. If this keeps happening, the rotation job is not running on any instance.
